  "Agent 1's active_historical_window() applies the frozen 5-iteration archive cadence in every run namespace, so each 8-iteration pilot schedules H005 opponents from iteration 6 onward (~383 games per pilot). The common contract states the cadence under the canonical run only; the scheduler follows Agent 1's namespace-independent function rather than making a new decision. Agents 5/6 must therefore archive an immutable pilot snapshot after pilot iteration 5, or those scheduled games have no opponent weights to load",
